#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/legal.rst:11
msgid "Disclaimer"
msgstr "Declinare de responsabilitate"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/legal.rst:13
msgid ""
"The CMUcam1 was designed very carefully. We have made every effort to avoid "
"mistakes but we cannot guarantee that the CMUCam1 is free of errors. The "
"information found on this website is given as an indication."
msgstr ""
"CMUcam1 a fost proiectat cu foarte multă grijă. Am făcut toate eforturile "
"pentru a evita greșelile, dar nu putem garanta că CMUCam1 este lipsit de "
"erori. Informațiile găsite pe acest site web sunt oferite ca indicație."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/legal.rst:18
